      "message": "feat(ui): move the Work offset control from the Setup page to the WCS page\n\nThe Work offset (G54-G59) picker is drawn on the WCS page in its own\ngroup. The Setup page keeps the part orientation controls and the\n\"Set WCS from features\" row. The command and the setup's slot are\nunchanged.\n\nFixes #1648\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
